  "published": "2026-09-27T19:57:44.687Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Four new rules: LC060 reports EF Core async operators such as ToListAsync on a query built with AsQueryable() over an in-memory list, which throw at run time; LC061 reports EF.CompileQuery and EF.CompileAsyncQuery calls that compile the query again on every call; LC062 reports blocking on an EF Core async call with .Result, .Wait() or .GetAwaiter().GetResult(); LC063 reports a user-started transaction on a context configured with a retrying execution strategy, which EF Core rejects. LC060, LC062 and LC063 join the critical preset. False positives found by scanning real apps are fixed in LC001, LC004, LC008, LC011, LC016, LC020, LC022, LC024 (EF Core 8+ GroupBy translation), LC035 and LC039.",
